<doc id="26858" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=26858" title="Jalur Yokosuka">
Jalur Yokosuka

Jalur Yokosuka (横須賀線, Yokosuka-sen&lt;a href="Sistim%20tulis%20Jepang"&gt;?&lt;/a&gt;) nyaéta salah sahiji jalur &lt;a href="Rail%20transport"&gt;kareta&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="East%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;JR East&lt;/a&gt;.
Jalur ieu panjangna 73.3&amp;nbsp;km ti &lt;a href="Stasion%20Tokyo"&gt;Stasion Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; ka &lt;a href="Kurihama%20Station"&gt;Kurihama Station&lt;/a&gt;, ku 1,067&amp;nbsp;mm sarta trek ganda antara Tokyo jeung Yokosuka. Ngaran resmi Jalur Yokosuka Line nujul kana segmen 23.9&amp;nbsp;km antara &lt;a href="%C5%8Cfuna%20Station"&gt;Ōfuna Station&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Kurihama%20Station"&gt;Kurihama Station&lt;/a&gt;, tapi ku sabab kareta di Jalur Yokosuka asalna ti Stasion Tokyo, rute kareta nu asup kana jalur ieu disebutna Jalur Yokosuka.
Jalur ieu di jero taneuh ti Tokyo ka Shinagawa (sajajar jeung &lt;a href="Jalur%20Utama%20T%C5%8Dkaid%C5%8D"&gt;Jalur Utama Tōkaidō&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jalur%20Yamanote"&gt;Jalur Yamanote&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Keihin-T%C5%8Dhoku%20Line"&gt;Keihin-Tōhoku Line&lt;/a&gt;), terus nyabang ka kulon nuturkeun &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dkaid%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tōkaidō Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; asup ka kota &lt;a href="Kawasaki%2C%20Kanagawa"&gt;Kawasaki&lt;/a&gt; (bagéan ieu, ilahar disebut Jalur Hinkaku (品鶴線, Hinkaku-sen&lt;a href="Sistim%20tulis%20Jepang"&gt;?&lt;/a&gt;), asalna jalur kareta barang ti Jalur Utama Tōkaidō). Ngahiji jeung Jalur Utama Tōkaidō Main di deukeut &lt;a href="Tsurumi%20Station"&gt;Tsurumi Station&lt;/a&gt; sarta nuturkeun Jalur Utama Tōkaidō ka &lt;a href="%C5%8Cfuna%20Station"&gt;Ōfuna&lt;/a&gt;, nu terus nyabang ka beulah kidul-wetannepi ka eureun di &lt;a href="Miura%20Peninsula"&gt;Miura Peninsula&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kareta</h2>
<ul>
<li>Kareta lokal Local nu eureun di unggal stasion sapanjang Jalur Yokosuka. Ilaharna 11-gerbong　tur dua gerbong mimiti mangrupa "Green Cars". Sababaraha ngagunakeun 4-gerbong kareta antara Zushi jeung Tokyo. Dina bagéan séjén, maké 11-gerbong jeung 4 gerbong sacara bébas.</li>
<li>Kareta &lt;a href="Sh%C5%8Dnan-Shinjuku%20Line"&gt;Shōnan-Shinjuku Line&lt;/a&gt; maké Jalur Yokosuka antara Nishi-Ōi jeung Zushi.</li>
<li>Ohayō Liner jeung Home Liner kareta komuter ekspres nu eureun di Tokyo, Shimbashi, Shinagawa, Ōfuna, Kamakura jeung Zushi.</li>
<li>Kareta &lt;a href="Narita%20Express"&gt;Narita Express&lt;/a&gt; eureun di Tokyo, Shinagawa, Yokohama, jeung Ōfuna.</li>
</ul>
Kareta.
Aya sababaraha layanan kareta (lolobana tujuan Tokyo) ka &lt;a href="S%C5%8Dbu%20Main%20Line"&gt;Sōbu Main Line&lt;/a&gt; tujuan &lt;a href="Stasion%20Tsudanuma"&gt;Tsudanuma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Stasion%20Chiba"&gt;Chiba&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Stasion%20Narut%C5%8D"&gt;Narutō&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Narita%20Line"&gt;Narita Line&lt;/a&gt; tujuan &lt;a href="Stasion%20Narita%20Airport"&gt;Narita Airport&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kashima%20Line"&gt;Kashima Line&lt;/a&gt; tujuan &lt;a href="Stasion%20Kashima-Jing%C5%AB"&gt;Kashima-Jingū&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sotob%C5%8D%20Line"&gt;Sotobō Line&lt;/a&gt; tujuan &lt;a href="Stasion%20Kazusa-Ichinomiya"&gt;Kazusa-Ichinomiya&lt;/a&gt;, sarta &lt;a href="Uchib%C5%8D%20Line"&gt;Uchibō Line&lt;/a&gt; tujuan &lt;a href="Stasion%20Kimitsu"&gt;Kimitsu&lt;/a&gt;. Kareta tujuan Stasion Narita Airport Station disebut Rapid &lt;a href="Airport%20Narita"&gt;Airport Narita&lt;/a&gt;, tapi sabalikna béda ngaran.
<h2>Stasion-stasion</h2>
Stasion-stasion.
Catetan yén Jalur Yokosuka teu ngaliwatan Stasion Kawasaki.
