<doc id="27290" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=27290" title="Jalur Utama Kagoshima">
Jalur Utama Kagoshima

Jalur Utama Kagoshima (鹿児島本線) nyaéta bagéan utama tina jaringan utama kareta &lt;a href="Kyushu%20Railway%20Company"&gt;JR Kyūshū&lt;/a&gt; tur manjang antara &lt;a href="Mojiko%20Station"&gt;Mojikō&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Kitakyushu%2C%20Fukuoka"&gt;Kitakyūshū&lt;/a&gt;, nepi ka &lt;a href="Kagoshima%20Station"&gt;Kagoshima Station&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Kagoshima%2C%20Kagoshima"&gt;Kagoshima City&lt;/a&gt;, di tungtung kidul &lt;a href="Ky%C5%ABsh%C5%AB"&gt;Kyūshū&lt;/a&gt;. Until &lt;a href="March%2013"&gt;March 13&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, it covered 393 kilométers between its two termini; however, with the opening of the &lt;a href="Kyushu%20Shinkansen"&gt;Kyūshū Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a href="March%2013"&gt;March 13&lt;/a&gt;, the section between Yatsushiro and Sendai was transferred to the third-sector &lt;a href="Hisatsu%20Orange%20Railway"&gt;Hisatsu Orange Railway Company&lt;/a&gt;. The line is the most important line in Kyūshū, connecting &lt;a href="Fukuoka%2C%20Fukuoka"&gt;Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Hakata%20Station"&gt;Hakata Station&lt;/a&gt;) to many other major cities. It is the main line through the Fukuoka urban district, and as such many long-distance express trains from all parts of Kyūshū utilize the section of line between &lt;a href="Kokura%20Station"&gt;Kokura Station&lt;/a&gt; (Kitakyūshū) and &lt;a href="Tosu%20Station"&gt;Tosu Station&lt;/a&gt;, where the &lt;a href="Nagasaki%20Main%20Line"&gt;main line&lt;/a&gt; to Nagasaki meets the Kagoshima Main Line.
